.TH TOTHEFRONT 1
.SH NAME
tothefront \- turn-based wargame
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/tothefront
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I ToTheFront
is a turn-based wargame.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Button 1 selects, moves, and attacks on a grid; space ends the phase. The opposing side is played by the machine.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B LMB
Select unit / move / attack per phase
.TP
.B space / n
End phase (player 0)
.TP
.B Enter / r
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/tothefront.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
